4. **Hub throughput capacity** (for each $h \in H$):
   $$
   \sum_{s \in S} f_{s h} \leq u_h
   $$
   - $f_{S1,H1} + f_{S2,H1} + f_{S3,H1} \leq 170$
   - $f_{S1,H2} + f_{S2,H2} + f_{S3,H2} \leq 160$

5. **Nonnegativity**:
   $$
   f_{ij} \geq 0 \quad \text{for all arcs } (i,j) \text{ listed above}
   $$

